# macos
**/.DS_Store

#typescript
**/node_modules
typescript/node_modules
typescript/.oracle-tmp

# agda
**/_build
# interface files: normally live in _build, but land next to sources under
# `agda --local-interfaces` (used to keep an experimental/dev interface cache
# isolated from the strict one).  Build artifacts either way — never commit.
**/*.agdai
**/_cli
**/_measure
**/_harness
**/_ih
**/_nc
dist-newstyle
agda/*.log
agda/*.out
/*.log
/*.out

# agda-dev generates stubbed copies here; build artifacts, never sources
_dev/

# python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
